{
  "an2.42:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 2.42–51 ",
  "an2.42:0.2": "The Chapter on Assemblies ",
  "an2.42:1.0": "42 ",
  "an2.42:1.1": "“There are, mendicants, these two assemblies. ",
  "an2.42:1.2": "What two? ",
  "an2.42:1.3": "A shallow assembly and a deep assembly. ",
  "an2.42:1.4": "And what is a shallow assembly? ",
  "an2.42:1.5": "An assembly where the mendicants are haughty, insolent, fickle, scurrilous, loose-tongued, unmindful, lacking situational awareness and immersion, with straying minds and undisciplined faculties. ",
  "an2.42:1.6": "This is called a shallow assembly. ",
  "an2.42:2.1": "And what is a deep assembly? ",
  "an2.42:2.2": "An assembly where the mendicants are not haughty, insolent, fickle, scurrilous, or loose-tongued, but have established mindfulness, situational awareness, immersion, unified minds, and restrained faculties. ",
  "an2.42:2.3": "This is called a deep assembly. ",
  "an2.42:2.4": "These are the two assemblies. ",
  "an2.42:2.5": "The better of these two assemblies is the deep assembly.” ",
  "an2.43:1.0": "43 ",
  "an2.43:1.1": "“There are, mendicants, these two assemblies. ",
  "an2.43:1.2": "What two? ",
  "an2.43:1.3": "A divided assembly and a harmonious assembly. ",
  "an2.43:1.4": "And what is a divided assembly? ",
  "an2.43:1.5": "An assembly where the mendicants fight, quarrel, and dispute, continually wounding each other with barbed words. ",
  "an2.43:1.6": "This is called a divided assembly. ",
  "an2.43:2.1": "And what is a harmonious assembl